  "slug": "batch-record-training-sign-off-form",
  "title": "Batch Record Training Sign-Off Form",
  "subtitle": "Assign the batch record curriculum, teach controlled references, observe task performance, remediate gaps, define authorization limits, and update qualification.",
  "description": "A competency-based batch record training sign-off form that records more than attendance by connecting instruction for the batch execution and production record control to observed demonstrations, explicit criteria, coaching, reassessment, authorization boundaries, and recurring review.",
  "use_case": "Use before a learner independently performs the batch execution and production record control or after a procedure change, transfer, lapse, or performance gap requires documented evaluation and role-specific sign-off.",
  "risk_tier": "A",
